stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> New
    New --> Triaged: QA lead reviews
    Triaged --> Rejected: not a defect / duplicate
    Triaged --> Assigned
    Assigned --> InProgress
    InProgress --> Fixed
    Fixed --> ReadyForRetest: deployed to test
    ReadyForRetest --> Closed: retest passed
    ReadyForRetest --> Reopened: retest failed
    Reopened --> Assigned
    Triaged --> Deferred: agreed for later release
